# Claude Code skills overlay for the `server-headless` profile.
# Active on hosts where profile_tag == server-headless (e.g. linuxbro, superbro).
#
# Format (same as skills.list): one skill source per line. Disable inherited
# skill from base with: !skill-source
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines ignored.

# --- examples (commented out — uncomment as needed) ---
# Disable dev-heavy skills inherited from base:
# !github:anthropic/skills/frontend-design
# !github:anthropic/skills/shopify-theme-development

